<section class="page-intro"><a href="/" class="breadcrumb">Home / Our world</a><span class="eyebrow">Kayvee Fashion</span><h1>A world of details.<br/><em>Make it personal.</em></h1><p>Your day. Your own direction.</p></section><section class="fashion-story about-story"><div class="fashion-story-photo"><img src="@Shop.Settings.Story" alt="The collection of Kayvee Fashion" width="900" height="1200"/></div><div class="fashion-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT US</span><h2>Get to know<br/><em>the collection.</em></h2><p>Explore the collection at your own pace. Save the details you love and bring your sizing, colour and delivery questions to the team.</p><p>From a sharp tailored silhouette to a softer knit layer, explore the collection imagery shared by Kayvee Fashion. Speak with the team on WhatsApp about your next look and delivery across Lebanon. Confirm fit, finish and current item details before choosing.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Explore the collection ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="@Shop.Settings.Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit our Instagram ↗</a></div></section><section class="section prose"><h2>Your own way to explore.</h2><p>Discover the pictured looks, keep a list of favourites and send a personal enquiry. Colours, sizing, availability and ordering details are confirmed directly with the team.</p><a class="text-link" href="/lookbook">Open the visual diary ↗</a></section>
